    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971610/extras/205cc8acb2d5e703b7ceec73ccdcca39.avif?t=1744965442\" width=600 height=136 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Overview.</h2>  HOLE is a low-resolution, gun jamming, single-player FPS.<br>  This is a small but hard gunfight.<br>  Let's clear jam with swearing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Play time</h2>  5 to 30 minutes per stage.<br>  No time limit.<br>  Assume 2-3 hours to unlock all stages (3 in total).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Recommended for</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Who do not have a lot of time to play, but want to enjoy hard fps<br></li><li>Who want to enjoy fps casually without fear of losing equipment.<br></li><li>Who want to play small single-player fps</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Cautions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No story.<br></li><li>There is no &quot;clear&quot; in the stage. Enemies spawn infinitely.<br></li><li>There are 3 stages in total. You can challenge only one at the beginning.<br></li><li>There are 4 guns in total. You can use only one at the beginning.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0How to play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Access the floating microwave oven and jump into the hole.<br></li><li>The stage is full of dangers. Try to stay alive.<br></li><li>When you want to return home, find the microwave oven again and jump into the hole.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Streaming</h2>  Streaming of this game is available with or without monetization.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2971610/extras/205cc8acb2d5e703b7ceec73ccdcca39.avif?t=1744965442\" width=600 height=136 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Overview.</h2>  HOLE is a low-resolution, gun jamming, single-player FPS.<br>  This is a small but hard gunfight.<br>  Let's clear jam with swearing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Play time</h2>  5 to 30 minutes per stage.<br>  No time limit.<br>  Assume 2-3 hours to unlock all stages (3 in total).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Recommended for</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Who do not have a lot of time to play, but want to enjoy hard fps<br></li><li>Who want to enjoy fps casually without fear of losing equipment.<br></li><li>Who want to play small single-player fps</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Cautions</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>No story.<br></li><li>There is no &quot;clear&quot; in the stage. Enemies spawn infinitely.<br></li><li>There are 3 stages in total. You can challenge only one at the beginning.<br></li><li>There are 4 guns in total. You can use only one at the beginning.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0How to play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Access the floating microwave oven and jump into the hole.<br></li><li>The stage is full of dangers. Try to stay alive.<br></li><li>When you want to return home, find the microwave oven again and jump into the hole.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0Streaming</h2>  Streaming of this game is available with or without monetization.",
